<title>SOUTH KOREA: Soccer-Results of South Korean pro-soccer games.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Results of South Korean pro-soccer games.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South Korean pro-soccer games played on Saturday.</p>
<p>    Chonnam     2    Chonbuk     0   (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Standings after games played on Saturday (Tabulate under - won, drawn, lost, goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p>			 W     D    L    G/F   G/A    P</p>
<p> Puchon		4     1    1     9     4    13</p>
<p> Chonan		3     1    2    16    14    10</p>
<p> Pohang		3     1    1    14    12    10</p>
<p> Chonnam	     2     3    1     7     5     9</p>
<p> Suwon		 1     4    0     7     3     7</p>
<p> Anyang		1     4    1    10    11     7</p>
<p> Chonbuk	     1     1    4     6    11     4</p>
<p> Ulsan		 1     0    4     9    13     3</p>
<p> Pusan		 0     3    2     7    12     3</p>
